&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Cognite, we&#39;re transforming the world&#39;s most asset-intensive industries through Industrial AI. Our customers rely on us to turn complex industrial data into meaningful business outcomes—and this is where you come in.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Project Manager who enjoys solving complex challenges, takes ownership of outcomes, and is motivated by delivering measurable value. This role goes beyond managing timelines; you&#39;ll lead transformational AI implementation projects that help some of the world&#39;s largest industrial organisations modernise the way they operate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From contract signing through deployment and value realisation, you&#39;ll partner with customers and cross-functional teams to deliver successful projects that create lasting business impact.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As the Project Manager, you&#39;ll be accountable for the successful delivery of complex Industrial AI implementation projects by:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading end-to-end project delivery from kickoff through deployment, adoption, and value realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning project scope, schedule, budget, quality, customer outcomes, and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Solution Architects, Software Engineers, Data Scientists, Product teams, and Customer Success to deliver high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating customer objectives into measurable success metrics and facilitating Value Realisation Workshops to demonstrate business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing project financials, including forecasting, revenue recognition, profitability, cost management, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trusted relationships with customer stakeholders, leading steering committees, and providing clear communication throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and managing risks, dependencies, and scope changes while ensuring appropriate governance and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting customer adoption through change management, enablement, and training while recognising opportunities to expand customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the continuous improvement of delivery practices by applying Cognite&#39;s PMO methodologies, playbooks, and lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience delivering complex software, SaaS, cloud, or enterprise technology implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing enterprise or industrial digital transformation programmes involving multiple stakeholders and technical workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with APIs, integrations, cloud platforms, data architecture, and enterprise systems, enabling effective collaboration with technical teams and informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen, including forecasting, revenue recognition, margin management, and project profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within Life Sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Agile delivery methodologies and project governance frameworks such as Scrum, PMP, or PRINCE2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to engage confidently across technical teams, customers, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using project management tools such as Jira, Confluence, Microsoft Project, or Smartsheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25% as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred skills:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re particularly interested if you also bring experience in:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, Agile, or Scrum certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platforms such as Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial IoT, SCADA, MES, or Operational Technology (OT) environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI, Machine Learning, Data Engineering, or Analytics implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cognite?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cognite, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve complex, real-world challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative, inclusive, and fast-moving environment where innovation, curiosity, and continuous learning are encouraged. We value diverse perspectives and believe great ideas come from people with different experiences and backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited by technology, enjoy working with customers to solve meaningful problems, and want to help shape the future of industry, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/resources/blog/key-highlights-from-impact-2025&quot;&gt;Impact 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Cognite&#39;s Industrial AI: Moonshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re globally recognized domain experts with an international presence that spans Phoenix, Houston, Oslo Tokyo, Bengaluru, and Abu Dhabi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bub-content-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constructor’s mission is to enable all educational organisations to provide high-quality digital education to 10x people with 10x efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With strong expertise in machine intelligence and data science, Constructor’s all-in-one platform for education and research addresses today’s pressing educational challenges: access inequality, tech clutter, and low engagement of students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please send your resume in English only.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Roadmap Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and drive a multi-year, outcome-based roadmap that aligns with global business goals and North Star metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead comprehensive market research to identify emerging trends in AI and EdTech, ensuring our product strategy remains ahead of the curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monetization &amp;amp; Pricing:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the pricing strategy for international markets. Conduct analysis to determine price floors and ceilings, and optimize monetization models to maximize LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scientific &amp;amp; Data Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply a scientific approach to product discovery. Analyze performance data to validate hypotheses and drive data-informed decision-making across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a key partner for the Leadership Team, delivering clear, data-backed insights and recommendations that influence company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, mentor, and scale a team of product managers, fostering a culture of accountability, growth, and high-quality PRD standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary point of contact for Engineering, Data Science, and Design teams to prioritize features and resolve technical/business trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as a Product Manager in software development (SaaS, EdTech, or AI-driven products).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Data Science, or a related technical/scientific field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage products using complex data analysis and scientific research methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of prioritization frameworks (e.g., RICE, WSJF) and experience building outcome-driven (not just feature-driven) roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of writing high-quality PRDs and managing sprints in a fast-paced, agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional stakeholders and directly mentoring other product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English with the ability to articulate technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Academic background in Business (MBA/BBA) or completion of advanced product strategy programs (e.g., Reforge, Kellogg, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and scaling &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML-powered products&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in &lt;strong&gt;Science&lt;/strong&gt; or experience with academic/research-focused software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing products with &lt;strong&gt;millions of users&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple geographical regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;💻 Choice of work equipment (e.g., laptop, monitor, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🇬🇧 English classes (iTalki – $130 monthly)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;⏰ Flexible schedule (we usually work between 09:00/10:00 and 18:00/19:00)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;👶 Newborn bonus (€500 per child)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧠 Patent remuneration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🌴 Paid leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧑‍💻 Remote work in locations without our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work in locations with offices (2 days in-office, 3 days remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Constructor&lt;/strong&gt; fosters equal opportunity for people of all backgrounds and identities. We are led by a gender-balanced board committed to building a diverse and inclusive organisation where everyone can become their best self. We do not discriminate based on age, disability, gender identity, sexual orientation, ethnicity, race, religion or belief, parental and family status, or other protected characteristics. We welcome applications from women, men and non-binary candidates of all ethnicities and socio-economic backgrounds. We encourage people belonging to underrepresented groups to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product Team is looking for a passionate and dedicated colleague to join them and build world-class products to move the performance marketing industry forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work closely with both internal and external developers to build plugins, connectors and other integrations including with e-commerce and customer data platforms. You will support the product backlog management and ensure that our products meet customer needs and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting role where you will build and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce landscape and industry trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you care about delivering products that customers love, enjoy working with different cultures, and meeting people from around the world, this position is a great opportunity for you. Join our team at our Product Hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;London, Amsterdam or Milan, &lt;/strong&gt;or work from another country where Awin has an office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you will collaborate with product managers to manage the backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will liaise between internal and external engineers, the UX team, and stakeholders to ensure clear communication of product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor product performance metrics and generate reports to support data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will partner with customer-facing teams to gather customer feedback and insights, and use that feedback to inform product development decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will identify opportunities with product peers to further add value to our plugins and various platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with the Product Marketing team to communicate releases and drive adoption of existing and new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce, customer-data platform landscape, and industry trends to inform product strategy for platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a bachelor’s degree in Business, Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent relevant work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have first experience or curiosity about working in product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience or high-level understanding of Ecommerce or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with web technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are data driven and possess analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in communicating with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-motivated, organised, capable of prioritising work and focusing on important tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appreciation&lt;/strong&gt;: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are hiring in multiple countries for this role. Additional benefits, including health and wellbeing offerings, will be discussed during the initial interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
