&lt;div&gt;Cloud or AI certifications (e.g. Azure AI Engineer, Azure Solutions Architect, AWS Machine Learning).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A leadership role bridging strategy, architecture and GenAI delivery, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on GenAI, agentic systems and support function transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A growth path towards senior programme and practice leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Logistics Tribe builds the systems powering end-to-end delivery across North America, Europe and Australia/New Zealand: getting fresh ingredients into our facilities, giving customers the best delivery options the network can support, and tracking every box to the customer&#39;s door. Today it is a single engineering team - two staff engineers, a data engineer and seven mid-to-senior engineers - led by the Director of Engineering, owning that software and keeping it running in production. You will join as an Engineering Manager and take line management of the seven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The work is operations-heavy and business-critical, spread across different subdomains. You won&#39;t own a fixed backlog in one corner of the domain; the team&#39;s scope follows where the business pressure is. That is reflected in how we work: rather than one fixed squad, the team organises into small, project-focused pods that form and dissolve as projects start and finish. In a typical sprint, your engineers might be spread across three projects with three different product managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategy and technical direction are things we shape together - staff engineers, product managers and you all contributing, nobody working from a script handed down. You own the people and the delivery of your engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports to the Director of Engineering for Logistics Tech; your team is spread across two geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of mid-to-senior engineers: set clear expectations, give regular and honest feedback, and own their development - including building the case when someone is ready for the next level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the people and stay technical. This role carries real hands-on expectations - you still deliver code yourself, not management at a distance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep raising the team&#39;s AI bar: role-model it in your own work, and push the workflows where AI genuinely changes how fast we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make our project-based way of working work for people. You lead project staffing with the Director of Engineering and the product managers, putting engineers where the work and their growth both fit. You limit how many projects anyone carries, and you keep handovers clean so nobody becomes a single point of failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery health of your team&#39;s work together with the product managers and the engineers leading each project: realistic plans, sound quality, and systems that stay reliable once shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and onboard well - you&#39;ll be building the team&#39;s balance of skills as projects and domains shift under you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the engineering practices we care about: behaviour-driven tests for every business use case, and small iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape tribe culture as part of the leadership team, in a setup that is deliberately flat and collaborative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years leading mid-to-senior engineers in an agile environment, backed by 6+ years of total engineering experience - you&#39;ve run development and growth conversations and seen people through to promotion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading people through changing project boundaries - this is a team that reforms around projects, not one that sits still.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A backend-leaning technical grounding - event-driven microservices, Kubernetes, Kafka, relational databases, CI/CD - with real BDD/TDD habits that make large refactorings safe. You don&#39;t need to be the deepest engineer in the room, but you need to earn the team&#39;s respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, practical experience building with AI tooling: you&#39;ve shipped real work with it, you know where it fails, and you learn as readily from others as they learn from you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-oriented mindset: you can reason about the business problem, prioritise for customer impact, and push back on low-value scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in physical-world and supply-chain problems. You want to understand how the operation actually works; logistics or carrier integration experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don&#39;t &quot;tick all the boxes&quot; but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager (Technical) who wants to help define how trust is built into the next generation of AI systems. At Affinidi, we’re building the Trust Fabric product suite to give AI agents verifiable identity, policy guardrails, and real-time observability, so organisations can move from promising proofs of concept to secure, governed production deployments with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for builders. You’ll work side by side with engineering to turn ambitious ideas into real, high-impact products, fast, iteratively, and with strong product judgment. You’ll take on complex, ambiguous challenges that don’t come with a playbook, bring structure to what matters, and help the team move with clarity, speed, and conviction. You’ll also collaborate with deeply engaged teams and senior leaders in an environment that expects high standards, values ownership, and gives you the chance to shape meaningful products from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you like combining technical depth, product thinking, and execution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape and deliver solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineers to define and refine solutions early, helping move ideas from concept to production in practical, incremental steps while staying close enough to implementation to understand trade-offs and guide decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive focused, outcome-oriented delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance user needs, market context, and execution speed while focusing on getting working solutions into users’ hands for validation, then iterate based on feedback and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work through ambiguity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership of areas where requirements are not fully defined, structure problems into clear, actionable paths forward, and maintain momentum even as direction continues to evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own product direction:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to product strategy and roadmap definition, align short-term priorities with longer-term platform thinking, and make thoughtful trade-offs that support both delivery and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate across stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work across engineering, design, and go-to-market teams, engage effectively with senior and executive stakeholders, and bring alignment and clarity in environments with diverse perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be developer-obsessed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand developer workflows and key pain points, and help improve integration, usability, and the overall product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Core experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You bring 5+ years of experience in Technical Product Management, a strong technical background that lets you engage deeply with engineering topics, hands-on experience working with APIs, systems, and integrations, and a proven track record of delivering products in close collaboration with engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical depth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are comfortable understanding how systems are designed and operate in practice, able to engage in technical discussions, challenge assumptions, and evaluate trade-offs, and willing to go into detail when needed by reviewing flows, investigating issues, or clarifying implementation approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You take ownership from problem to outcome, are comfortable working with ambiguity and evolving priorities, combine structured thinking with a bias toward action, and can move between big-picture strategy and practical execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You communicate effectively across technical and non-technical audiences, are comfortable working with experienced, highly engaged stakeholders, and know how to build alignment and drive decisions forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;It’s a plus if you have had exposure to identity, distributed systems, or similar domains, and experience in fast-paced, product-led environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A team that values ownership, quality, and speed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Close collaboration between product and engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hybrid working model in Berlin + flexible hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unlimited vacation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A strong environment to learn, build, and have impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of International – Real Time Operations, you will own the strategy and execution for expanding the Fusus platform into international markets. This role is central to ensuring that Fusus can compete, win, and deliver at scale outside the U.S., while remaining aligned with Axon’s broader global product strategy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will define the expansion and maturity model that ensures Fusus succeeds internationally, harmonizing requirements across regions while avoiding “parity for parity’s sake.” You will partner closely with sales leadership and new markets international leadership to understand tender pipelines and prioritize the right investments that enables Axon to win deals and delight customers, while balancing core deliverables and sustainability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This position requires a leader who can both lead directly and influence without direct authority, working across product, engineering, sales, and program teams to set strategy, make tradeoffs, and align on execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the international product strategy for Fusus, balancing competitiveness, sustainability, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with international sales leadership to evaluate pipeline opportunities, shape tender responses, and prioritize engineering work to win deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harmonize requirements across countries and regions, ensuring strategic parity with U.S. markets where necessary, while building features and capabilities that truly matter for international success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, and program leaders to ensure international deliverables are embedded in Axon’s global roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with regional security, privacy, and data residency standards critical to customer trust and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement in tender readiness, adoption, and customer success metrics across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a champion for international customer and partner needs within RTO, ensuring they inform product priorities at all stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This role is based out of our London office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;SVP &amp;amp; General Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across Axon (devices, digital evidence, productivity solutions) to deliver integrated outcomes internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead direct engagement with international customers, regulators, and partners to distill insights into product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a clear execution path within 90 days that defines roadmap priorities and sequencing for international expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with the Head of International (Core Products &amp;amp; New Markets) to ensure RTO’s global efforts are consistent with company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create frameworks and processes that balance local customization with global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a visible leader and trusted advisor for RTO’s international strategy, both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product management experience in enterprise SaaS, real-time operations, VSaaS, VMS, IoT, or public safety technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in international product leadership, including experience scaling platforms across multiple regions with diverse compliance and operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with sales leadership on tender-driven opportunities, translating deal pipelines into prioritized product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of global compliance standards (privacy, data residency, security) and their impact on product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to harmonize requirements across geographies while balancing global parity vs. regional differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills; able to influence senior leaders and cross-functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; MBA or advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Visionary:&lt;/strong&gt; Anticipates international market needs and positions Axon ahead of competitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially Astute:&lt;/strong&gt; Connects product strategy to tender wins, deal pipelines, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Join Forces Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrives in cross-functional, collaborative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operationally Disciplined:&lt;/strong&gt; Brings clarity and structure to complex, multi-region priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensures that every decision ladders up to better outcomes for global customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Now&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global demand for real-time intelligence and operational platforms is growing rapidly. Public safety and enterprise customers outside the U.S. require solutions that are secure, compliant, and scalable. This is a unique opportunity to define and lead Axon’s international expansion for Real-Time Operations, directly shaping how Fusus competes and delivers worldwide—and advancing our mission to Protect Life at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
