&lt;div&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’Oréal International Distribution (LID) is a premier global media planning and activation account spanning &lt;strong&gt;30+ international markets&lt;/strong&gt; and five powerhouse L’Oréal divisions: &lt;strong&gt;Luxe, Consumer Products (CPD), L’Oréal Dermatological Beauty (LDB), Professional Products (PPD), and Dragon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As part of the account’s relocation from London to Paris, we are building out our on-the-ground client delivery hub. We are opening &lt;strong&gt;four new Implementation Planning Manager seats&lt;/strong&gt; in Paris to form the engine room of our media operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Implementation Planning Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the hands-on owner of campaign delivery. Sitting under a Planning Director, you will take briefs from brand teams, build multi-market channel plans, coordinate local agency teams, and direct our specialized Delhi activation desks. Across the account’s &lt;strong&gt;c.200 annual activations&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the driving force ensuring media launches go live accurately, on time, and on budget.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. End-to-End Media Planning &amp;amp; Craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Plans Unsupervised:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate marketing briefs into actionable, robust media plans—defining audience segments, channel mix, budget splits by market, flighting/phasing, cost benchmarks, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tier 2 &amp;amp; Always-On Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full autonomous ownership of Tier 2 product activations and always-on campaigns for your assigned division, while actively supporting your Planning Director on Tier 1 flagship &quot;big-bet&quot; launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Excel Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; Master complex, multi-currency plan templates, maintaining airtight budget tracking and financial hygiene in coordination with internal Finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Activation Directing &amp;amp; Offshore QA (Delhi Hub)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actionable Briefing:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate central plans into precise media briefs and trafficking instructions for our specialist Delhi activation desks (Paid Social, Programmatic, Amazon Search).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorous Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion QA standards so campaigns go live right the first time; monitor delivery pacing and quickly troubleshoot optimization or tracking issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Analytics to build data-driven Post-Campaign Reviews, identifying actionable insights for future campaign iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Stakeholder &amp;amp; Market Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with local market agency teams across Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa to obtain local media rate cards, availability, and cultural nuances, synthesizing inputs into one unified plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Interface:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner day-to-day with client brand managers and divisional coordinators in Paris, fielding planning queries, presenting plan options, and holding delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Negotiable Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 to 5 years of digital media planning experience&lt;/strong&gt; within a media agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Market Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to international / multi-territory accounts, with an understanding of how to plan across differing market maturity levels and budget sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent Planning Craft:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability to take a client brief from scratch and build out a multi-channel plan (digital-first, with holistic channel awareness) without close supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident communicator who is comfortable following up with local markets, channel specialists, and creative stakeholders to gather missing inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Excel Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in Excel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Fluent English&lt;/strong&gt; is mandatory. Must be currently &lt;strong&gt;based in Paris or actively relocating&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual English / French:&lt;/strong&gt; A major advantage for daily, informal interactions with Parisian brand coordinators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Affinity:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience planning for &lt;strong&gt;Beauty, Fragrance, FMCG, or Luxury&lt;/strong&gt; brands is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offline &amp;amp; Retail Media Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with high-impact offline touchpoints and e-commerce/retail media (e.g., Amazon Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Presentation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable walking client brand managers through plan rationales and budget allocations independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join This Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine Campaign Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end-to-end media activations across 30 diverse markets for globally recognized beauty and fragrance houses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand-New Paris Hub:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a newly forming team with a collaborative startup energy, supported by the stability and scale of a premier global agency account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Behind You:&lt;/strong&gt; Lean on dedicated offshore activation desks for technical execution, allowing you to focus on planning craft, client consultation, and strategic optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast-Track Progression:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly under newly appointed Directors and an account Lead committed to developing internal talent into future leadership seats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consult our privacy policy to learn all about the protection of your data. Although we review all applications received, we only contact those selected for an interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;#LI-PROMOTED&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Venn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn is the sovereign AI platform for real estate. We turn each company’s data, knowledge and way of operating into its own Company Brain, then build bespoke applications and AI agents on top of it to grow revenue, reduce costs and improve performance. The intelligence stays the customer’s proprietary asset and compounds over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 270 owners and operators run on Venn across 30 states and five countries. Our customers include Related, Bozzuto and Kairoi Residential in the U.S. and Grand City Properties in Europe. Our platform is approaching one million homes, and our contracted revenue has more than quadrupled in the past year. Venn has raised over $140 million from investors including Group 11 and NOA, and recently acquired a16z-backed Zuma to accelerate our AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make sure AI sharpens what makes a real estate company different, instead of erasing it. Come build it with us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn partners with a leading German residential property company that manages a large portfolio across the country. As our Senior Technical Customer Success Manager in Berlin, you will own this strategic relationship end to end, from onboarding and implementation through long-term adoption. You are hands-on and technical: you understand the client&#39;s business and systems, and you build the automations, implementation tools and training that make the rollout succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the client&#39;s primary point of contact and their voice inside Venn, working closely with our Product, Engineering, Support and Data teams. You work independently, see the big picture, and drive results without waiting for direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After 12 months, success means the rollout phases are live on schedule, adoption targets are met across the client&#39;s teams, and the client sees Venn as a trusted long-term partner. [REVIEW: confirm the 12-month success measures] As Venn grows in Germany, you will have room to help build the customer success function here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client relationship end to end, as the primary point of contact for stakeholders from property managers to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead onboarding and implementation on the client side together with Venn&#39;s Product and Engineering teams: timelines, stakeholders, configuration, integrations and go-lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automations, implementation tools and processes that make onboarding faster and repeatable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver training programs and materials, building the client&#39;s self-sufficiency on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption across a large, distributed portfolio, including property management, customer service and back-office teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the client&#39;s priorities and systems, and translate them into clear, prioritized requirements for Venn&#39;s Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical issues with the client and work with Venn&#39;s Support and Engineering teams to resolve them [REVIEW: align with Eli on what Support covers (language, hours, location) and adjust this line]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on user engagement and value against agreed KPIs, including regular business reviews and steering meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate German-specific requirements and stakeholders, such as data protection (GDPR) and works council processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share German market and localization insights to help shape Venn&#39;s product for Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in customer-facing roles in B2B SaaS, such as Customer Success, Technical CSM, Implementation or Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background: hands-on with integrations, APIs, data and automation or no-code tools, and comfortable troubleshooting technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading enterprise software implementations with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German and English (C1 or higher), written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent self-starter who takes ownership, sees the big picture and engages confidently with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly, within Germany and to Venn&#39;s offices abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin and eligible to work in Germany [REVIEW (HR / Deel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in German residential real estate (Wohnungswirtschaft, Hausverwaltung) or with software for the property sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proptech, startup or scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ERP environments such as SAP, and with CRM, support and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer success processes or playbooks from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international teams across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;backend systems (TypeScript, microservices, cloud)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead multiple engineering teams building the &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi Elements &lt;/strong&gt;platform. While you will manage and support teams working across the full stack (backend, frontend, platform infrastructure), your technical depth and demonstrated experience in backend engineering will be crucial in guiding architecture, ensuring quality, and driving technical strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: you will grow high-performing fullstack teams, define best practices across the stack, and remain hands-on in critical technical decisions to ensure our systems are secure, scalable, and performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work culture at &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&lt;/strong&gt; is shaped by the following tenets:   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unapologetically customer-focused &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We invest in cultures and teams to enable high performance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embraces experimentation and builds fast &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have the courage to be misunderstood &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We work together to unlock data   &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams, providing &lt;strong&gt;vision, direction, and coaching&lt;/strong&gt; to managers, staff engineers, and senior ICs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;engineering execution and on-time delivery&lt;/strong&gt; of secure, performant, and customer-centric systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and contribute to the design and development of &lt;strong&gt;high-scale, high-performance distributed production systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and business stakeholders to define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;technology roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices, delivery processes, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt; to scale effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineering leaders, fostering &lt;strong&gt;career growth, leadership depth, and technical excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of &lt;strong&gt;emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing innovative approaches to improve scalability, architecture, and developer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion &lt;strong&gt;privacy by design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;security-first principles&lt;/strong&gt;, and high-quality engineering across backend and frontend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will be a great match if you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading engineering organizations in global, high-growth environments while driving on-time delivery of high-quality systems at scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong &lt;strong&gt; leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;: coaching, mentoring, developing leaders, and fostering high-performing, inclusive teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;strategic vision&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;practical execution&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning engineering teams with business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;strong&gt;Dart &lt;/strong&gt;experience is preferred; familiarity with C#, Go, or similar is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt; React/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrates solid understanding of modern web and/or mobile development practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven success in &lt;strong&gt;designing, deploying, and scaling microservices&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud environments, specifically, Amazon Web Services (AWS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for &lt;strong&gt;privacy, security, cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;, and resilient system design; experience with &lt;strong&gt;asynchronous cryptography and identity/authentication domains&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, growing teams while staying engaged in critical technical decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with product, design, and security stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving startup environments&lt;/strong&gt;, building autonomous teams that experiment, learn, and deliver at speed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across functions, locations, and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend expertise in RUST&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in decentralized identity solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems with advanced cryptography requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within international environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Budget &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sport Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
