&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design the paid acquisition and retention creative that does the heavy lifting for Fanatics Casino, and build out the visual system behind it so it&#39;s faster to produce, easier to test and better looking than anything else in the category. You&#39;ll bring hands-on design and innovation, playing into current trends and inventing new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance design at our scale means real volume, constant testing, many states and plenty of compliance requirements. We want you to make it a craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design across performance media: paid social, display, programmatic, app store, affiliate and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve modular, test-ready templates and component libraries that allow rapid versioning while every asset still feels crafted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design state-by-state and market-by-market compliance lockups (responsible gaming messaging, age requirements, terms) that are clear, legible and on-brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Paid Media and Analytics on structured tests (layout, offer presentation, imagery, colour, CTA) and turn the results into better design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside designers, motion designers and creative ops on shared projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep static and animated assets forming a single system with Motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore dynamic creative, automation and AI-assisted versioning workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off clean files: correct naming, sensible versioning, layers someone else can open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in graphic or digital design, with significant performance or direct-response work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio showing high-volume performance creative and strong craft side by side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with design systems and templates in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, and motion design programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working understanding of performance metrics, and examples of design decisions you made because of data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing design output across multiple markets and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong typography, hierarchy and layout skills at small sizes on busy feeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speed and accuracy together: you can move fast and get it right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to take direction, sharpen the work and keep moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iGaming, sportsbook, fintech or app-based subscription experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DCO platforms or creative automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing app store assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
